From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 04:13:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: one open-human-ask predicate for the badge, stored
 outcome and session stripe
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

[daveey] card_is_open_human_ask is shared by the count filter, replica bucket, _card_items and the row field
needs_you. sessionStatusStripe paints stuck first whenever an ask is open (unless ⌘B-parked). Card
block/unblock/complete/archive refresh origin/shepherd chats' stored outcomes post-commit.
desktop_stripe_report logs stripe-invariant-violation.
